<view class="page">
  <view class="favorite-hero card">
    <view>
      <text class="favorite-title">关注摊主，出摊别错过</text>
      <text class="favorite-sub">关注后自动展示摊主最近一场出摊；到时间会在小程序内弹窗提醒。</text>
    </view>
    <button class="mini-btn ghost" bindtap="locate">按距离</button>
  </view>

  <view class="section-title">
    <text class="section-title-main">已关注摊主 {{items.length}}</text>
    <text class="section-title-sub">下拉刷新最新状态</text>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="loading">正在读取关注…</view>

  <block wx:elif="{{items.length}}">
    <stall-card
      wx:for="{{items}}"
      wx:key="_id"
      stall="{{item}}"
      bind:open="openStall"
      bind:favorite="favorite"
    />
  </block>

  <view wx:else class="empty card">
    <image class="empty-art" src="/assets/icons/follow.png" mode="aspectFit" />
    <text class="empty-title">还没有关注摊主</text>
    <text class="empty-copy">遇到喜欢的摊主，点一下爱心即可持续关注后续出摊。</text>
    <button class="primary-btn explore" bindtap="goHome">去附近找摊</button>
  </view>
</view>
